---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const updated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-IN', { day:'numeric', month:'long', year:'numeric' }).format(new Date());
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How The Crux handles your data.">
  <article class="container">
    <header style="padding-top:32px;">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="dateline">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The Crux ("we", "our") is committed to protecting the privacy of its readers. This policy explains what data we collect, why, and what your rights are.</p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use privacy-first web analytics that record anonymous, aggregated visit data (page viewed, country, referrer, device type). No personally identifying information is collected.</p>
      <p><strong>Contact:</strong> if you email us, your message and email address are retained only as long as necessary to respond.</p>

      <h2>2. Affiliate links and cookies</h2>
      <p>Some links in our reviews are affiliate links. When you click one, the retailer may set a cookie to attribute a purchase, so we earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This never affects our recommendations — see our <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>. We do not run third-party display advertising.</p>

      <h2>3. Your rights under the DPDP Act, 2023 (India) and GDPR (EEA)</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of any personal data we hold about you. Write to <a href="mailto:privacy@thecruxco.com">privacy@thecruxco.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

      <h2>4. Children</h2>
      <p>The Crux is intended for readers aged 16 and above. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

      <h2>5. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as the site evolves. Material changes will be flagged on the homepage.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions: <a href="mailto:privacy@thecruxco.com">privacy@thecruxco.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
